  <item>
    <title>AI周棋洛翻唱《Christmas List》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694b861f0f2ae6a867e424eb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694b861f0f2ae6a867e424eb</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Dec 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>源：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/artist?id=14470054" data-url="https://music.163.com/artist?id=14470054"><span>Anson Seabra</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>==</span></p><span></span><p><span>There's an angel in the snow</span></p><span></span><p><span>雪中氤氲出天使的身影</span></p><span></span><p><span>She's knocking at my door</span></p><span></span><p><span>今夜 她将叩响我的家门</span></p><span></span><p><span>She's keeping my heart warm tonight</span></p><span></span><p><span>温暖一颗本来冰冷的心</span></p><span></span><p><span>And there's a table set for two</span></p><span></span><p><span>烛光小桌静静等待两人</span></p><span></span><p><span>A cozy little room</span></p><span></span><p><span>依偎在舒适的小窝一角</span></p><span></span><p><span>A window with а view of white</span></p><span></span><p><span>能看到窗外飘落的漫天白雪</span></p><span></span><p><span>Then you ask me what I want this year</span></p><span></span><p><span>你问我今年许下什么心愿</span></p><span></span><p><span>Well I already know</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想我已经有了答案</span></p><span></span><p><span>l tried to make my Christmas list</span></p><span></span><p><span>我本想列一张圣诞愿望清单</span></p><span></span><p><span>But I don't want a single gift</span></p><span></span><p><span>却无从落笔</span></p><span></span><p><span>'Cause l've got everything I need</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为我已经拥有梦寐以求的一切</span></p><span></span><p><span>So I won't ask for anything</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个圣诞 我不再许愿</span></p><span></span><p><span>No shiny toys or fancy things</span></p><span></span><p><span>漂亮的玩具 精美的礼物 变得毫无意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>'Cause l've got everything I need</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为有你在我身边</span></p><span></span><p><span>With you here next to me</span></p><span></span><p><span>我就拥有了一切</span></p><span></span><p><span>There's a sleigh up in the sky</span></p><span></span><p><span>麋鹿的铃响滚过天边</span></p><span></span><p><span>With presents piled high</span></p><span></span><p><span>圣诞老人的雪橇上堆满礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span>But none of them are mine tonight</span></p><span></span><p><span>只是今夜 我的袜子空空如也</span></p><span></span><p><span>'Cause my gift doesn't need a bow</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的礼物不必系上蝴蝶结</span></p><span></span><p><span>It's perfect on its own</span></p><span></span><p><span>就已经完美得</span></p><span></span><p><span>And I just wanna hold it tight</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我想揉进怀里 再也不放手</span></p><span></span><p><span>So don't ask me what I want this year</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一次 就不要问我圣诞心愿</span></p><span></span><p><span>'Cause you already know '</span></p><span></span><p><span>你一定猜中了我的答案</span></p><span></span><p><span>I tried to make my Christmas list</span></p><span></span><p><span>我本想列一张圣诞愿望清单</span></p><span></span><p><span>But I don't want а single gift</span></p><span></span><p><span>却无从落笔</span></p><span></span><p><span>'Cause l've got everything I need</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为我已经拥有梦寐以求的一切</span></p><span></span><p><span>So I won't ask for anything</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个圣诞 我不再许愿</span></p><span></span><p><span>No shiny toys or fancy things</span></p><span></span><p><span>漂亮的玩具 精美的礼物 变得毫无意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>'Cause l've got everything I need</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为我已经拥有梦寐以求的一切</span></p><span></span><p><span>I could lie and say I want a sweater</span></p><span></span><p><span>我当然能编个小谎 许愿一件毛衣</span></p><span></span><p><span>A holiday to warmer weather</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个温暖的假期</span></p><span></span><p><span>But that's just not the truth</span></p><span></span><p><span>但那些都不是我的本意</span></p><span></span><p><span>Because all of Santa's elves could never</span></p><span></span><p><span>就算是圣诞老人的小精灵</span></p><span></span><p><span>Make а gift for me that's better</span></p><span></span><p><span>做出最棒的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span>Than this night with you</span></p><span></span><p><span>也比不上和你共同度过的圣诞夜</span></p><span></span><p><span>I don't want something new</span>